{"suttaId":"tha-ap312","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9207,9227],"vripara":"47"},"segments":{"tha-ap312:0.3":"Pabbhāradāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap312:1.1":"“Piyadassino bhagavato, pabbhāro sodhito mayā;","tha-ap312:1.3":"Ghaṭakañca upaṭṭhāsiṃ, paribhogāya tādino.","tha-ap312:2.1":"“Taṃ me buddho viyākāsi, piyadassī mahāmuni;","tha-ap312:2.3":"Sahassakaṇḍo satabheṇḍu [satageṇḍu (syā. ka.)], dhajālu haritāmayo.","tha-ap312:3.1":"“Nibbattissati so yūpo, ratanañca anappakaṃ;","tha-ap312:3.3":"Pabbhāradānaṃ datvāna, kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ.","tha-ap312:4.1":"“Ito bāttiṃsakappamhi, susuddho nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap312:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap312:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap312:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pabbhāradāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap312:7.1":"Pabbhāradāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap312:8.1":"Padumakesaravaggo ekatiṃsatimo.","tha-ap312:9.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap312:10.1":"Kesaraṃ gandhamannañca, dhammasaññī phalena ca;","tha-ap312:10.3":"Pasādārāmadāyī ca, lepako buddhasaññako;","tha-ap312:10.5":"Pabbhārado ca gāthāyo, ekapaññāsa kittitā."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
